{
  "_note": "Copy to dev.json (git-ignored) and run: flutter run --dart-define-from-file=env/dev.json. API_BASE_URL includes /api/v1. The Android emulator reaches the host machine as 10.0.2.2, the iOS simulator as localhost; a real device needs the machine's LAN address and its own debug exception (plain http is allowed for localhost and 10.0.2.2 only).",
  "API_BASE_URL": "http://10.0.2.2:8080/api/v1"
